</given-names></name><name><surname>Jonsson</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Lingvall</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Microbial dynamics during aerobic deterioration of silages</article-title><source>J Sci Food Agric</source><year>1985</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>765</fpage><lpage>774</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/jsfa.2740360902</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Loncarevic</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Tham</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Danielsson-Tham</surname><given-names>M-L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence of <italic>Listeria monocytogenes </italic>and other Listeria spp. in smoked and "gravad" fish</article-title><source>Acta vet scand</source><year>1996</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>18</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8659342</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McDonald</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Henderson</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Heron</surname><given-names>SJE</given-names></name></person-group><source>The biochemistry of silage</source><year>1991</year><edition>2</edition><publisher-name>Chalcombe Publications, Marlow, Bucks, UK</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>M&#x000f6;ller</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Klaesson</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Lingvall</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Pauly T et al</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Correlation between colour and temperature of LDPE stretch film used in silage bales</article-title><source>Proc of the XIIth International Silage Conference Uppsala</source><year>1999</year><publisher-name>Swedish University of Agric. Sciences (SLU), Dept. of Animal Nutrition &#x00026; Management, Uppsala</publisher-name><fpage>251</fpage><lpage>252</lpage><comment>ISBN 91-576-5678-9</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>NMKL (Nordic Committee on Food Analysis)</collab></person-group><article-title>Nitrogen &#x02013; Best&#x000e4;mning i livsmedel och fodermedel efter Kjeldahl [Nitrogen &#x02013; determination in food and feed according to Kjeldahl]</article-title><source>Method #6</source><year>1976</year><edition>3</edition><publisher-name>NMKL, c/o Veterin&#x000e6;rinstituttet, Oslo, Norway</publisher-name><comment>(in Swedish)</comment></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Niemel&#x000e4;</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Statistical evaluation of results from quantitative microbiological examinations</article-title><source>Report #1</source><year>1983</year><edition>2</edition><publisher-name>Nordic Committee on Food Analysis (NMKL), c/o Veterin&#x000e6;rinstituttet, Oslo, Norway</publisher-name><fpage>31</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>&#x000d6;stling</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name><name><surname>Lindgren</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inhibition of enterobacteria and listeria growth by lactic, acetic and formic acids</article-title><source>J Appl Bacteriol</source><year>1993</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>18</fpage><lpage>24</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8365950</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pahlow</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Microbiology of inoculants, crops and silages</article-title><source>Proc of the EUROBAC Conference Aug 1986</source><year>1990</year><volume>3</volume><publisher-name>Swedish University of Agric. Sciences, Uppsala. Grass and Forage Reports</publisher-name><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>59</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pauly</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heterogeneity and hygienic quality of grass silage</article-title><source>PhD thesis</source><year>1999</year><publisher-name>Acta Universitatis Agriculturae Sueciae, Agraria #157. Swedish University of Agric. Sciences, Dept. of Animal Nutrition, Uppsala</publisher-name><fpage>94</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pettersson</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ensiling of forages, factors affecting silage fermentation and quality</article-title><source>PhD thesis</source><year>1988</year><publisher-name>Report no.179. Swedish University of Agric. Sciences, Dept. of Animal Nutrition, Uppsala</publisher-name><fpage>116</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rammer</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quality of grass silage infected with spores of <italic>Clostridium tyrobutyricum</italic></article-title><source>Grass Forage Sci</source><year>1996</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>88</fpage><lpage>95</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2494.1996.tb02041.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>R&#x000f6;del</surname><given-n